gXR(){return"AI-powered code review assistant for macOS, Windows, and Linux. Automate analyses, publish comments directly on Pull Requests, and reduce review time by up to 80%.\n\nMulti-VCS integration: Azure DevOps, GitHub, GitLab, and Bitbucket.\nAI providers: Google Gemini and OpenAI (ChatGPT).\nSide-by-side diff, draft comments, configurable tech stack (Android, iOS, Flutter, KMP), multiple tabs, and productivity shortcuts.\n\nBuilt with Kotlin Multiplatform."},
gYc(){return"SuperApp Magalu is one of the largest e-commerce platforms and retail ecosystems in Brazil, with over 100 million downloads.\n\nContribution (LuizaLabs - Senior Mobile Developer / Mobile SDK Technical Lead):\nActed as a hands-on technical leader on the mobile Ads platform team for the entire Magazine Luiza ecosystem, impacting Magalu, Netshoes, and Zattini applications. Led and contributed to native Ads SDK architecture (Android & iOS), integration contracts, version compatibility, tracking reliability, and standardization across consumer apps.\n\nGuided technical decisions using Clean Architecture, MVI, modularization, and SDK best practices to mitigate crash, ANR, regression, and metrics inconsistency risks in production. Supported high-scale delivery through trunk-based development, CI/CD, code review, regression control, technical documentation, and cross-functional collaboration with Product, Business, and consumer app engineering teams. Substantially improved team productivity through mentorship and practical adoption of AI and agentic engineering tools including Cursor, GitHub Copilot, Claude Code, ChatGPT, and Gemini."},
gYg(){return"Netshoes is the largest online sports store in Latin America, offering a massive catalog of footwear, apparel, sports equipment, and supplements.\n\nContribution (LuizaLabs - Senior Mobile Developer / Mobile SDK Technical Lead):\nAs a hands-on technical leader on the mobile Ads platform team for the Magazine Luiza ecosystem, led and contributed to the architecture, integration, and standardization of the native Ads SDK (Android & iOS) within the Netshoes consumer application, ensuring robust integration contracts and flawless tracking reliability.\n\nApplied Clean Architecture, MVI, modularization, and advanced SDK engineering practices to eliminate crash and ANR risks, prevent metrics inconsistencies, and avoid regressions. Enabled high-velocity delivery through trunk-based development, CI/CD pipelines, strict code reviews, and comprehensive technical documentation in alignment with engineering, Business, and Product teams. Boosted team throughput by incorporating state-of-the-art AI-assisted development tools like Cursor, GitHub Copilot, Claude Code, ChatGPT, and Gemini."},
gXJ(){return"Bradesco Net Empresa is the official corporate banking (PJ) application of Banco Bradesco. It enables secure transactions, Pix payments, tax settlements, credit lines, and real-time cash flow management.\n\nContribution:\nWorked on developing crucial corporate security features and mobile banking functionalities within this high-scale native application."},
gY8(){return"iPEP Mobile is a digital health mobile platform for diabetes patients, built for Glooko / monARC Bio, supporting multiple flavors (iPEP, Spark, Rybelsus, clinical trials, etc.).\n\nStack: React Native 0.69 \xb7 Redux \xb7 Firebase \xb7 Sentry \xb7 Fastlane \xb7 Bitrise \xb7 Kotlin \xb7 Swift \xb7 BLE \xb7 Realm \xb7 iOS \xb7 Android\n\nContribution (BLE / devices):\nImplemented native BLE communication with Accu-Chek Guide meters and Dexcom CGM sensors. Developed Native Modules (Android/Kotlin and iOS/Swift) for the React Native \u2194 hardware bridge. Built pairing, scan, and reconnection flows with Bluetooth state handling (permissions, activation, background). Synchronized glucose readings and device events with encrypted Realm Database. Integrated @glooko/react-native-accu-chek and @glooko/react-native-dexcom packages. Handled native events (sensor warm-up, algorithm changes, connection errors) exposed to the JS layer."},
gYp(){return"WeDoc is a platform and social network built exclusively for physicians and medical students, connecting over 25,000 professionals for clinical case discussions, free courses, job offers, and professional networking.\n\nContribution:\nWorked on developing new features, improving user experience, and enhancing overall stability in the native mobile application."},
gYh(){return"The Philadelphia Inquirer is the official news app for one of the most traditional newspapers in the United States, offering award-winning journalism, regional daily news, and real-time sports coverage.\n\nContribution (Curotec LLM - Senior Mobile Developer):\nWorking on the full redesign of the native app for Android and iOS, contributing to planning, design and ideation \u2014 with a special focus on Ads \u2014 plus hands-on development with Jetpack Compose on Android and SwiftUI on iOS."},
gXQ(){return"LoRa tracker search app by serial number.\n\n* Login requires a CEABS Servi\xe7os S.A. Technical Representative account. For questions, contact the support center. More information on our website."},
gYn(){return"The YCard app is the easiest way to issue your UDFE Student ID (CIE). Through a simple step-by-step process, you can get your ID without leaving home, school, or college.\n\nWith YCard, you also get a powerful financial education tool to manage a free prepaid Mastercard International card when you get your UDFE Student ID.\n\nAccess news, offers, coupons, and the VoltaQui! cashback program at over 20,000 merchants across Brazil."},
gXP(){return"Service order closing application.\n\n* Login requires a CEABS Servi\xe7os S.A. Technical Representative account. For questions, contact the support center. More information on our website."},
gXK(){return"New Dirija Bem app from Bradesco Seguros.\n\nAnalyze all your trips and track the evolution of your driving behavior.\n\nUsing your smartphone sensors, the app collects information about your driving quality. No action is needed to start a trip \u2014 just place the phone inside your vehicle during the route.\n\nInformation such as time, distance, speed, and smoothness is used to generate a score for each trip and an overall traffic behavior score."},
gY9(){return"Welcome to the world of connected cars. Liberty Seguros offers a new way to relate to your insurance.\n\nTo use this app, you need to connect the device provided by Liberty to your vehicle.\n\nWith the equipment installed, you get access to services including driving behavior, driver score, trip details, and help finding your parked vehicle (last position)."},
gXH(){return"*Only for subscribers\n\nBroadcast \u2014 real-time news, quotes, and analyses for decision-making anywhere.\n\nKey features: Latest news, real-time quotes, daily and intraday charts, world indexes, national and international markets, information watchlists, cross rates, market radar, and commodities."},
gXI(){return"The Stock Exchange App is a great option for tracking the situation and movement of various stock exchanges. The app runs on Android mobile devices and shows users what life is like as a securities broker, simplifying money management with information updated every 15 minutes relative to the real market."},
gYd(){return"Operating from 2004 to 2015, MalaPronta.com was one of Brazil's leading online hotel booking companies. Through this app you could search and book hotels, manage reservations, favorite hotels, read guest reviews, and send digital postcards from your trips."},
